---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Ring Size Chart — Bez Ambar"
  description="Find your perfect ring size with our US and international ring size chart, measurement guide, and professional fitting tips."
  canonical="https://bezambar.com/ring-size-chart"
>

<style is:global>
  .rsc-hero {
    padding: 140px 20px 60px;
    text-align: center;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.06);
  }
  .rsc-hero h1 {
    font-family: var(--serif, 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif);
    font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 52px);
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--ink, #1a1a1a);
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }
  .rsc-hero p {
    font-family: 'EB Garamond', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 18px;
    color: #666;
    max-width: 580px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }
  .rsc-contact-note {
    text-align: center;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: #999;
    padding: 20px;
  }
  .rsc-contact-note a { color: var(--accent, #95826b); text-decoration: none; }
  .rsc-section {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 60px 24px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.06);
  }
  .rsc-section h2 {
    font-family: var(--serif, 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif);
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--ink, #1a1a1a);
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }
  .rsc-section > p { font-family: 'EB Garamond', Georgia, serif; font-size: 17px; color: #666; line-height: 1.65; margin-bottom: 32px; }
  .rsc-methods {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 32px;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }
  .rsc-method {
    background: #faf7f2;
    padding: 28px;
  }
  .rsc-method h3 {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink, #1a1a1a);
    margin: 0 0 16px;
  }
  .rsc-method ol {
    font-family: 'EB Garamond', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: #555;
    padding-left: 20px;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .rsc-tips {
    background: #faf7f2;
    padding: 28px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .rsc-tips h3 {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink, #1a1a1a);
    margin: 0 0 16px;
  }
  .rsc-tips ul {
    font-family: 'EB Garamond', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: #555;
    padding-left: 20px;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .rsc-table-wrap { overflow-x: auto; margin: 24px 0; }
  .rsc-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 12px;
  }
  .rsc-table th {
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink, #1a1a1a);
    padding: 12px 16px;
    border-bottom: 2px solid rgba(0,0,0,.1);
    text-align: left;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .rsc-table td {
    padding: 10px 16px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.05);
    color: #555;
  }
  .rsc-table .rsc-highlight td { background: #faf7f2; color: var(--ink, #1a1a1a); font-weight: 500; }
  .rsc-section strong { color: var(--ink, #1a1a1a); }
  .rsc-cta-section {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 72px 20px;
    background: var(--ink, #1a1a1a);
    color: #fff;
  }
  .rsc-cta-section h2 {
    font-family: var(--serif, 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif);
    font-size: clamp(24px, 3.5vw, 36px);
    font-weight: 300;
    color: #fff;
    margin: 0 0 12px;
  }
  .rsc-cta-section p { font-family: 'EB Garamond', Georgia, serif; font-size: 17px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6); margin: 0 0 28px; }
  .rsc-cta-section a {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.22em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #fff;
    text-decoration: none;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.35);
    padding: 14px 36px;
    transition: border-color 0.2s, color 0.2s;
  }
  .rsc-cta-section a:hover { border-color: var(--accent, #95826b); color: var(--accent, #95826b); }
  @media (max-width: 600px) { .rsc-methods { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>

  <div class="rsc-hero">
    <h1>Ring Size Chart</h1>
    <p>Finding your perfect ring size is essential for a comfortable fit. Use our guide below to measure your ring size at home, or visit us in Los Angeles for a professional fitting.</p>
  </div>

  <p class="rsc-contact-note">Have questions? Call us at <a href="tel:2136299191">213-629-9191</a> and our team will be happy to assist you.</p>

  <section class="rsc-section">
    <h2>How to Measure Your Ring Size at Home</h2>
    <div class="rsc-methods">
      <div class="rsc-method">
        <h3>Method 1: Measure an Existing Ring</h3>
        <ol>
          <li>Find a ring that fits the intended finger comfortably.</li>
          <li>Measure the inside diameter in millimeters.</li>
          <li>Match the measurement to the chart below.</li>
        </ol>
      </div>
      <div class="rsc-method">
        <h3>Method 2: Use a String or Paper Strip</h3>
        <ol>
          <li>Cut a thin strip of paper and wrap it around the base of the ring finger.</li>
          <li>Mark the point where the strip overlaps.</li>
          <li>Measure the length in millimeters with a ruler.</li>
          <li>Match the circumference to the chart below.</li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="rsc-tips">
      <h3>Tips for an Accurate Measurement</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Measure your finger over the knuckle to ensure the ring slides on comfortably.</li>
        <li>Fingers swell in summer. Measure during warm conditions for a realistic fit.</li>
        <li>Wider bands fit tighter. Add a quarter size when purchasing a wide band.</li>
        <li>Warm up your hands before measuring for the most accurate result.</li>
        <li>Your dominant hand tends to be slightly larger. Measure the specific finger you plan to wear the ring on.</li>
        <li>Do not measure when your finger is swollen from exercise, heat, or salt intake.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <p style="margin-top:24px;">For the most accurate sizing, we recommend visiting a local jeweler who can use a professional mandrel or finger gauge.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="rsc-section">
    <h2>US &amp; International Ring Size Chart</h2>
