    </div>

    <p><strong>Note:</strong> This chart is for reference only. For the most precise sizing, we recommend a professional fitting. Eternity rings cannot be resized — an accurate measurement is especially important for these pieces.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="rsc-cta-section">
    <h2>Find Your Perfect Ring</h2>
    <p>Browse our collection of rings, engagement rings, and fine jewelry.</p>
    <a href="/collection?cat=rings">Shop Rings</a>
  </section>
</Layout>
